        {
          "content": "<p>成都当代艺术馆去年对外开放，有着宽檐的大屋顶，既像传统的川西民居，又像成都四周的群山，还可以用作户外活动。（<a href=\"https://www.163.com/dy/article/HDOVSF1R051285HS.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">via</a>）</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "via",
              "url": "https://www.163.com/dy/article/HDOVSF1R051285HS.html"
            }
          ],
